Hi,

Buildroot is a simple tool for creating complete embedded Linux systems
(http://buildroot.net).

Buildroot 2015.08.1 is released - Go download it at:

http://buildroot.net/downloads/buildroot-2015.08.1.tar.gz

or

http://buildroot.net/downloads/buildroot-2015.08.1.tar.bz2

Or get it from Git:

git://git.buildroot.net/buildroot

Buildroot 2015.08.1 is a bugfix release, fixing critical issues
discovered since the 2015.08 release.

See the changes file for details:

http://git.buildroot.net/buildroot/plain/CHANGES?id=2015.08.1

Many thanks to all the people contributing to this release:

